  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Emergency Medical Team component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK-Med is the delivery partner for UK-EMT. UK-Med is a nongovernmental organisation (NGO) with close ties to the NHS. In partnership with FCDO, this forms HMG&#x2019;s only Emergency Medical Team (EMT) which is classified by the WHO as a Type 2 team with a Rehab specialist care tea, capable of deploying a Field Hospital with medical, surgical, disease outbreak, and logistics specialists.</narrative>
  </description>
